== 2. Retry-After ==
LULUS  2.1 header detik 30
LULUS  2.2 header 0 -> clamp 1
LULUS  2.3 header 600 -> clamp 120
LULUS  2.4 header null -> null
LULUS  2.5 header sampah -> null
